---
description: Parametric CAD generation, validation, and manufacturing handoff rules
globs: "**/*.py,**/*.toml,**/*.step,**/*.stp,**/*.dxf,**/*.svg,**/*.pdf"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use `build123d==0.11.1` and the pinned project MCP.
- Build explicit named parts incrementally; render and measure after major features.
- Edit generator/config source, never generated STEP/DXF as the normal change path.
- Verify solids, expected bounding boxes, part count, placement, collisions, service zones, and controlled views before export.
- Save revisioned validation evidence and map it to requirement IDs.
- Treat STEP as neutral geometry, PDF as controlled design intent, and DXF as a gated manufacturing derivative.
- Bent-sheet DXF is reference-only until target-factory DFM and bend/flat-pattern responsibility are recorded.

